[
  {
    "id": "N01",
    "start": 1,
    "end": 23,
    "text": "搬來臺北的第七天，以安下班回到租屋處。她放好包，脫下鞋，終於坐了下來。門邊的垃圾和回收物，還等著帶下樓。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N01.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N02",
    "start": 29,
    "end": 44,
    "text": "才休息一下，巷子裡就傳來熟悉的旋律。她看了看門邊，趕緊穿好鞋，提起早已分好的兩袋東西。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N02.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N03",
    "start": 52.5,
    "end": 68,
    "text": "樓梯窄，她沒有跑。一隻手提著袋子，另一隻手扶著扶手，慢慢往下走。到了轉角，忽然聽見瓶罐碰撞的聲音。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N03.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N04a",
    "start": 71,
    "end": 80,
    "text": "是陳阿姨。她的回收袋勾住扶手，兩個瓶子和一個空罐落在平台上。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N04a.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N04b",
    "start": 80,
    "end": 88,
    "text": "以安先放好自己的袋子，蹲下幫忙撿。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N04b.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N04c",
    "start": 93.5,
    "end": 100,
    "text": "阿姨扶著袋口。瓶罐放回去，地上也收拾乾淨了。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N04c.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N05a",
    "start": 102,
    "end": 114,
    "text": "走出公寓，垃圾車還停在巷口。以安加快腳步。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N05a.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N05b",
    "start": 116,
    "end": 125,
    "text": "她跨過小水窪，在隊伍後方停下。阿姨慢慢跟了上來。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N05b.mp3",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "style": "general",
    "volume": "0"
  },
  {
    "id": "N06a",
    "start": 129,
    "end": 136,
    "text": "她把一般垃圾交給工作人員，等對方接住，才鬆手。",
    "voice": "zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural",
    "pitch": "0",
    "delivery": "off-screen third-person narrator; no lip sync",
    "file": "assets/audio/narration/N06a.mp3",
